<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA V AUSTRALIA FIRST TEST SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA V AUSTRALIA FIRST TEST SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard on the fifth and</p>
<p>final day of the first test between South Africa and Australia</p>
<p>at the Wanderers on Tuesday:</p>
<p>South Africa first innings 302 (H.Cronje 76, D.Richardson 72</p>
<p>not out)</p>
<p>Australia first innings 628-8 declared (G.Blewett 214,</p>
<p>S.Waugh 160, M.Elliott 85)</p>
<p>South Africa second innings (overnight 99-4):</p>
<p> A.Hudson run out			     31</p>
<p> G.Kirsten b Warne			     8</p>
<p> J.Kallis b Warne			     39</p>
<p> D.Cullinan c Healy b Warne		  0</p>
<p> H.Cronje c Healy b S.Waugh		 22</p>
<p> J.Rhodes lbw Warne			    8</p>
<p> S.Pollock not out			    14</p>
<p> L.Klusener c Hayden b Bevan		 0</p>
<p> D.Richardson c Hayden b Bevan	     2</p>
<p> A.Donald b Bevan				0</p>
<p> P.Adams b Bevan				 0</p>
<p> Extras (b-4 lb-2)			     6</p>
<p> Total (69 overs)			    130</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-36 2-41 3-46 4-90 5-108 6-127 7-128 8-130</p>
<p>9-130.</p>
<p>Bowling: McGrath 10-5-17-0, Gillespie 11-4-24-0, Warne</p>
<p>28-15-43-4, Bevan 15-3-32-4, S.Waugh 4-1-4-1, M.Waugh 1-0-4-0.</p>
<p>Result: Australia won by an innings and 196 runs.</p>
<p>Second test: Port Elizabeth, March 14-18.</p>
</text>
